/// The HTTP layer asks `%%RESOURCES%%:read` for the index and show pages; the
/// use cases agree: listing needs the read grant, loading one %%NOUN%% also
/// accepts the write grant (edit and update load the %%NOUN%% they change),
/// and changes need the write grant.
